[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0958","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0958.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67430","title":"MCP Ruby SDK 会话未过期导致内存耗尽漏洞","description":"MCP Ruby SDK 中的 StreamableHTTPTransport 组件在默认配置下不会过期会话，每次成功的 initialize 请求都会创建一个新的 ServerSession 对象并永久保留，仅通过客户端主动发送 HTTP DELETE 才能释放。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可反复发送初始化请求并立即断开连接，导致服务器内存中堆积大量 ServerSession 对象直至耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 mcp gem 0.23.0 之前的所有版本，已在 0.23.0 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67430","GHSA-52jp-gj8w-j6xh"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:11Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:30:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 mcp gem 至 v0.23.0 或以上版本，该版本已修复默认 session 永不过期问题。如无法立即升级，可在初始化 StreamableHTTPTransport 时显式设置 session_idle_timeout 参数（如 1800 秒），并添加 max_sessions 上限限制（如 1000），同时在反向代理层限制单 IP 的 POST 请求频率以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/afb968c468c178c4d3294b423fcce250621692f4","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/releases/tag/v0.23.0","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-52jp-gj8w-j6xh","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/1fe38c32f136c99453f4b0912eefa3da079988c2/gems/mcp/CVE-2026-67430.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-07-07-CVE-2026-67430.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/828bc0c3d151d823031bb5f4967fccfb52da9ec4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-67430.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67430.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/gem/mcp/CVE-2026-67430.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0958.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0958.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0958.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0929","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0929.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-63119","title":"MCP Ruby SDK stdio 传输无限制行缓冲区导致内存耗尽拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MCP Ruby SDK 的 stdio 传输层（MCP::Server::Transports::StdioTransport 和 MCP::Client::Stdio）在读取换行符分隔的 JSON-RPC 帧时，使用 IO#gets 方法且未设置字节长度限制。攻击者可通过持续发送不含换行符的数据流，使 gets 方法无限累积字符串内容，最终耗尽进程内存导致服务崩溃（DoS）。该漏洞影响 mcp gem 0.23.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。修复方式为升级至 0.23.0 版本，或对 gets 调用添加 4 MiB 的最大行长度限制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-63119","GHSA-7683-3w9x-ch42"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:30:33Z","remediation":"立即将 mcp gem 升级至 0.23.0 或更高版本（`gem update mcp`）。如无法升级，在调用 `StdioTransport` 和 `Client::Stdio` 的代码中为 `IO#gets` 添加第二个参数限制最大读取字节数（建议 4MB），并捕获超限异常关闭连接。对于 HTTP-to-stdio 桥接部署，在转发层增加帧长度校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/267b8fa6285453525c81ce43db6b7dcd7a8a8c2f","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/releases/tag/v0.23.0","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-7683-3w9x-ch42","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/1fe38c32f136c99453f4b0912eefa3da079988c2/gems/mcp/CVE-2026-63119.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2026/63xxx/CVE-2026-63119.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/63xxx/CVE-2026-63119.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-07-07-CVE-2026-63119.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-63119.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-63119.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-63119.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-63119.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/0b3a6d2dd2e98c1505f2a4ab6d48402e1d0da9c5/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-63119.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-63119.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0929.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0928","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0928.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-63118","title":"MCP Ruby SDK DNS重绑定漏洞","description":"MCP Ruby SDK（mcp gem）的 StreamableHTTPTransport 在处理 HTTP 请求时未验证 Host 和 Origin 请求头，存在 DNS 重绑定漏洞。攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，利用 DNS 重绑定技术将域名解析到本地回环地址（127.0.0.1），从而绕过同源策略访问受害者本地运行的 MCP 服务器。成功利用后，攻击者可枚举服务器暴露的工具列表并调用任意工具，窃取文件、密钥、命令输出等敏感数据。该漏洞影响 mcp gem 0.23.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。官方已在 0.23.0 版本中通过添加 Host/Origin 白名单机制修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-63118","GHSA-rjr6-rcgv-9m7m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:30:33Z","remediation":"立即将 mcp gem 升级至 0.23.0 或以上版本（`gem install mcp -v '>= 0.23.0'`），该版本在 StreamableHTTPTransport 中新增了 Host/Origin 白名单校验，默认仅允许回环地址访问。如无法立即升级，可在应用层添加 Rack 中间件对 HTTP Host 和 Origin 头进行白名单校验，拒绝非 localhost 来源的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/commit/ba543083a7594e7892b29464b89091816446ff7a","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/releases/tag/v0.23.0","https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/ruby-sdk/security/advisories/GHSA-rjr6-rcgv-9m7m","https://github.com/rubysec/ruby-advisory-db/blob/1fe38c32f136c99453f4b0912eefa3da079988c2/gems/mcp/CVE-2026-63118.yml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2026/63xxx/CVE-2026-63118.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/63xxx/CVE-2026-63118.json","https://github.com/rubysec/rubysec.github.io/blob/0a5bc60878096d39ce1382513d3aa01b5d5c73a3/advisories/_posts/2026-07-07-CVE-2026-63118.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-63118.json","https://github.com/mcp-security-project/mcp-cve-project/blob/8f19c6692789742733d784a4d63207b68cb14525/cves/CVE-2026-63118.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-63118.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/5499e4705bdb8a2f56d7bc3b0340cc070d431d74/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-63118.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-63118.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-63118.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0928.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0928.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0928.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0885","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0885.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-18266","title":"Dify AI Workflow 开放重定向漏洞","description":"Dify AI Workflow 的 AppInitializer 组件在处理 OAuth 认证流程时存在开放重定向漏洞。由于未对 oauth_redirect_url 参数进行充分校验，远程攻击者可构造恶意 URL 诱导用户点击，将用户重定向至攻击者控制的恶意站点，从而窃取敏感信息或实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞需要用户交互才能触发，攻击者须诱使用户访问恶意页面。影响 Dify AI Workflow 相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.4，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-18266"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-29T20:17:02Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:19:24Z","remediation":"立即将 Dify 升级至 v1.14.1 或更高版本（最新为 v1.16.1），该版本包含多项安全加固。如无法立即升级，在反向代理层配置白名单规则，仅允许 OAuth 回调跳转到可信域名列表，拒绝所有未在白名单中的重定向目标；同时在 Dify 的 OAuth 配置中严格校验 `oauth_redirect_url` 参数，禁止跳转到外部不可信站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zerodayinitiative.com/advisories/ZDI-26-452/","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/dify/CVE-2026-18266.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/dify/CVE-2026-18266.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/18xxx/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/18xxx/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-182xx/CVE-2026-18266.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/97de0a0c0be6241ec441ae8eb7c7943a5ff88d4f/content/posts/cve-2026-18266.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/59d57936496f37081433ba541bca8c4d04c17f7f/api/2026/CVE-2026-18266.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0885.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0956","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0956.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67429","title":"FlytoHub Flyto2 Core 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"` tags as specified.<value>Flyto2 Core 是一款用于自动化和 AI 代理工作流的执行内核。在 2.26.6 版本之前，其 `image.download` 及相关文件写入模块未使用集中式路径校验函数 `validate_path_with_env_config`，而是采用调用方可控的 `output_dir` 作为写入基准目录。由于该基准目录本身由攻击者指定，`os.path.commonpath` 的路径校验形同虚设，攻击者可通过特制参数将任意 HTTP 响应内容写入进程可访问的任意文件系统路径。受影响模块包括 `image.download`、`image.convert`、`image.resize`、`image.crop`、`image.compress`、`image.rotate`、`image.watermark`、`image.qrcode_generate`、`document.excel_write`、`document.pdf_fill_form`、`document.word_to_pdf`、`document.pdf_to_word` 及 `browser.pagination` 等。该漏洞影响通过 MCP 工具或托管 API 调用模块的场景，攻击者可利用其绕过 `FLYTO_SANDBOX_DIR` 沙盒限制，向沙盒外目录写入任意内容，进而覆盖配置文件、植入 Shell 脚本、修改 cron 任务或替换 Python 模块，最终导致远程代码执行。官方已在 2.26.6 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67429","GHSA-2956-977x-2w3r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:41:25Z","remediation":"升级到 Flyto2 Core 2.26.6 或更高版本。此版本已修复 image.download 及所有文件写入模块的路径校验缺陷，统一使用 validate_path_with_env_config() 将写入操作限制在 FLYTO_SANDBOX_DIR 沙箱目录内。如无法立即升级，请确保 FLYTO_SANDBOX_DIR 环境变量已设置为受限目录，禁止向外部模块传递 output_dir 参数，并限制能调用 file-writing 模块的主体权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/d5f89d71303e3c1e6418d347c5c55fcd173cc8cc","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.6","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-2956-977x-2w3r","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flyto2/CVE-2026-67429.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flyto2/CVE-2026-67429.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67429.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67429.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/flyto-core/CVE-2026-67429.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0956.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0956.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0956.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0954","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0954.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67428","title":"Flytohub Flyto2 Core 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Flyto2 Core 是一款用于自动化和 AI 代理工作流的执行内核。该产品的多个 HTTP 输出模块（包括 core.api.http_get、core.api.http_post、graphql.query、graphql.mutation、monitor.http_check、notification.discord.send_message、notification.slack.send_message、notification.teams.send_message、ai.vision_analyze、verify.visual_diff、browser.proxy_rotate 及 agent/llm 内联 base_url 分支）在向外部发送请求时，未调用项目自带的 SSRF 防护函数 validate_url_with_env_config，导致经过身份认证的工作流作者可构造包含云实例元数据地址（169.254.169.254）、回环地址或 RFC1918 内网地址的请求，从而对内网服务或云元数据端点发起服务端请求伪造攻击。攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取云实例的 IAM 凭据或读取/写入内部网络中的敏感资源，影响版本为 2.26.7 之前的所有版本，CVSSv3.1 评分为 8.5。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67428","GHSA-pgwh-4jj4-qm8v"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:41:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 Flyto2 Core 至 2.26.7 或更高版本，补丁已对受影响模块统一加入 validate_url_with_env_config 校验。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理或防火墙层出站规则中拦截对 169.254.169.254、127.0.0.1/8 及 RFC1918 内网地址的请求，并关闭不需要的外联模块权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/0a0a528520ec18f5a21f1ddf858a71cc1edfb6e9","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.7","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-pgwh-4jj4-qm8v","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flyto2/CVE-2026-67428.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flyto2/CVE-2026-67428.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67428.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/589311de821634bb522e792ce81e4454553aa500/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67428.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67428.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67428.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67428.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/828bc0c3d151d823031bb5f4967fccfb52da9ec4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-67428.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67428.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67428.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0954.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0954.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0954.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0952","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0952.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67427","title":"Flyto2 Core 环境变量信息泄露漏洞","description":"Flyto2 Core 工作流引擎的变量解析器在解析 `${env.VAR}` 插值时，会直接读取主机任意环境变量且未受功能策略白名单约束。尽管厂商默认拒绝 `env.get` 与 `env.load_dotenv` 模块以防止敏感信息泄露，但插值发生在模块策略门控之前，攻击者仍可通过工作流参数或 API/MCP 接口输入 `${env.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY}` 等表达式，绕过模块黑名单读取 API 密钥、DSN 等机密，并通过被允许的外发模块将解析后的明文密钥发送至攻击者控制的服务器。该漏洞影响 2.26.6 之前的所有版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67427","GHSA-hr7p-wg7r-hg9m"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:27:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 Flyto2 Core 至 2.26.6 或更高版本。该版本对变量解析器中的 ${env.*} 插值施加与 env.get 相同的显式 allowlist 策略，默认拒绝未授权环境变量访问。如无法立即升级，临时缓解措施：在 module_policy.py 中扩展 enforce_module_policy 以拦截 ${env.*} 解析路径，或在工作流参数传入层过滤含 ${env. 前缀的字符串，防止敏感凭据被外传。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/d5f89d71303e3c1e6418d347c5c55fcd173cc8cc","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.6","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-hr7p-wg7r-hg9m","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flyto2/CVE-2026-67427.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flyto2/CVE-2026-67427.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67427.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67427.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/flyto-core/CVE-2026-67427.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0952.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0950","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0950.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67426","title":"Flyto2 Core 未授权服务端请求伪造与内部运行器密钥泄露漏洞","description":"Flyto2 Core 是用于自动化与 AI Agent 工作流的执行内核，其 2.26.7 之前的版本中，独立的 flyto-verification 验证服务存在缺失关键功能认证（CWE-306）漏洞。该服务在 0.0.0.0:8344 端口监听并暴露无需认证的 POST /run 接口，攻击者无需任何权限即可通过网络远程访问。漏洞根因在于：/run 接口未设置任何认证依赖（缺少 Depends 认证检查）；请求体中的 callback_url 被原样用于发起出站 POST 请求，既未经过 target_allowed 白名单校验，也没有任何 SSRF 防护检查；同时服务在发出回调时无条件携带 X-Internal-Key 头，泄露环境变量 FLYTO_RUNNER_SECRET。攻击者可构造恶意 callback_url 指向内网或云元数据地址，实现带可控 JSON 请求体的未授权 SSRF 访问内部接口，或将内部 runner 密钥外泄至攻击者控制的服务器，进而伪造认证回调接管真实引擎通信。该漏洞影响 Flyto2 Core 2.26.6 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，官方已在 2.26.7 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67426","GHSA-jx74-cqjv-2c67"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:41:25Z","remediation":"建议立即将 flyto-core 升级至 2.26.7 或更高版本，官方已在该版本修复此漏洞（commit 0a0a528，参考 GHSA-jx74-cqjv-2c67）。如无法立即升级，请采取以下临时缓解措施：1）在防火墙上将 8344 端口（flyto-verification 服务监听端口）限制为仅回环地址 127.0.0.1 可访问，禁止外部网络访问，并修改 Dockerfile.verification 将启动参数由 0.0.0.0 改为 127.0.0.1；2）配置服务代理前，在网关或反向代理层对 /run 端点强制要求身份认证（如 API Key），拦截未经认证的 POST 请求；3）设置对外部回调 URL 的 SSRF 防护，仅允许访问预设的内网信任主机清单，拒绝指向云元数据地址（如 169.254.169.254）及内网 IP 的回调；4）及时轮换已泄露的 FLYTO_RUNNER_SECRET 环境变量值，避免旧密钥被利用伪造回调。升级前请勿将 flyto-verification 暴露于不可信网络。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/0a0a528520ec18f5a21f1ddf858a71cc1edfb6e9","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.7","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-jx74-cqjv-2c67","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67426.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67426.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/flyto-core/CVE-2026-67426.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-67426/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-67426/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0950.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0950.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0950.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0947","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0947.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67425","title":"Flyto2 Core LLM/API密钥泄露漏洞","description":"Flyto2 Core 是自动化与 AI 代理工作流的执行内核。在 2.26.6 版本之前，其 llm.chat 函数会从环境变量中读取 OPENAI_API_KEY、ANTHROPIC_API_KEY 等提供商密钥，并将其通过 Authorization: Bearer 请求头发送到调用者可控的 base_url 参数指向的端点。由于 SSRF 防护仅阻止内网地址而允许任意公网主机，攻击者可通过控制 base_url 参数将请求重定向至自己控制的服务器，从而窃取运营者的 API 密钥。该漏洞影响 Flyto2 Core 所有低于 2.26.6 的版本，攻击者无需认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67425","GHSA-qq9q-xgm3-xv9g"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:41:25Z","remediation":"升级 Flyto2 Core 至 v2.26.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 llm.chat 将环境变量中的 API 密钥发送至攻击者可控 base_url 的问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在 llm.chat、ai.model、llm.agent 及 vector.connector 中向不可信来源传递自定义 base_url 参数，并审查所有调用方对 base_url 的控制权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/d5f89d71303e3c1e6418d347c5c55fcd173cc8cc","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.6","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-qq9q-xgm3-xv9g","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln/flyto2/CVE-2026-67425.yaml","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/536340d55f91e2a0c09223b3194e9dd68ac48811/data/vuln_en/flyto2/CVE-2026-67425.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67425.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67425.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67425.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67425.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67425.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/d0b723b438bfd3686f3f24bd293dc7e10f2d140a/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-67425.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67425.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-67425.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0947.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0947.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0946","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0946.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-67424","title":"Flyto2 Core flyto-core HTTP重定向SSRF漏洞","description":"Flyto2 Core 自动化与 AI 代理工作流执行内核的 HTTP 模块（http.get、http.request、http.batch）存在服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。这些模块仅对初始 URL 进行 SSRF 安全检查，但在使用 aiohttp 默认的 allow_redirects=True 跟随重定向时，未对每个跳转的 Location 进行重新验证。攻击者可托管一个公共 URL 并使其 302 重定向到内部地址（如云元数据服务、内网服务），从而绕过 SSRF 防护读取内部响应内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 2.26.7 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。攻击者需具备低权限即可远程利用，无需用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-67424","GHSA-c9hr-64h3-gxpc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T19:16:51Z","updated":"2026-07-30T16:41:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 Flyto2 Core 至 v2.26.7 或更高版本，该版本在 commit 0a0a528 中修复了 SSRF 重定向绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 http.get/http.request/http.batch 时手动设置 allow_redirects=False，并对每个 Location 重定向目标调用 validate_url_with_env_config 重新校验后再跟进。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/commit/0a0a528520ec18f5a21f1ddf858a71cc1edfb6e9","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/releases/tag/v2.26.7","https://github.com/flytohub/flyto-core/security/advisories/GHSA-c9hr-64h3-gxpc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/67xxx/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-67424.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-674xx/CVE-2026-67424.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/flyto-core/CVE-2026-67424.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-67424/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d2f211a2392a33dc3802dfba918604d771c8ebf3/2026/CVE-2026-67424/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0946.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0789","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0789.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54705","title":"MathLive MathLive 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"MathLive 是一个用于数学公式显示和输入的 Web 组件库，其 0.110.0 之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。漏洞源于 `src/core/box.ts` 中 `Box.toMarkup` 方法在拼接 `this.value` 到渲染的 span 元素时未进行 HTML 转义，同时 `src/formats/atom-to-math-ml.ts` 中的 MathML 序列化器也存在独立的转义缺失问题。`\\text{}` 和 `\\mbox{}` 命令接受任意字符并原样输出到 HTML 和 MathML 标记中，导致攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 HTML/JavaScript 的 LaTeX 表达式（如 `\\text{<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>}`）实现任意 JavaScript 代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用 MathLive 渲染不可信数学表达式的应用，攻击者只需诱导用户访问包含恶意 LaTeX 内容的页面即可触发，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中危。官方已在 0.110.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54705","GHSA-fm7p-gw32-828p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T18:16:54Z","updated":"2026-07-30T20:07:01Z","remediation":"立即将 mathlive 升级至 0.110.0 或更高版本，该版本在 `Box.toMarkup` 和 MathML 序列化器中增加了对 `\\text{}`、`\\mbox{}` 等文本模式内容的 HTML 转义处理。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对所有用户输入的 LaTeX 表达式进行 HTML 实体编码（转义 `<`、`>`、`&`、`\"` 字符）后再传入 `convertLatexToMarkup` 或 `<math-span>` 等 API，同时部署 Content-Security-Policy 头（`script-src 'self'`）作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/arnog/mathlive/commit/5fe1c46153883f9ec0249a5c8c34e64aaae9cfb8","https://github.com/arnog/mathlive/issues/3028","https://github.com/arnog/mathlive/security/advisories/GHSA-fm7p-gw32-828p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54705.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54705.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/mathlive/CVE-2026-54705.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54705.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54705.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0789.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0789.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0789.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0795","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0795.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54727","title":"Termux proot-distro 容器隔离绕过漏洞","description":"proot-distro 是一款用于管理 proot 容器的 Termux 工具，其 restore 命令在处理用户提供的恶意备份归档文件时存在容器隔离绕过漏洞。由于恢复过程中未验证硬链接条目的源容器是否与目标容器一致，攻击者可通过构造包含跨容器硬链接的恶意 tar 归档文件，诱骗用户执行 restore 操作，从而在不同容器之间复制文件。该漏洞可导致攻击者读取其他容器中的敏感文件（如 SSH 私钥、API 凭证、数据库文件）或向其他容器注入恶意文件，破坏容器间的隔离边界。攻击条件为受害者使用 proot-distro restore 恢复攻击者提供的特制备份文件，无需 root 权限。该漏洞影响 proot-distro 5.1.5 及之前版本，已在 5.1.6 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54727","GHSA-7h3g-4w2f-fj2f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T17:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T20:07:01Z","remediation":"立即将 proot-distro 升级至 v5.1.6 或更高版本（`pkg upgrade proot-distro`）。如无法升级，避免使用 `proot-distro restore` 命令恢复来自不可信来源的备份归档文件，并手动检查归档中是否存在跨容器硬链接条目（`linkname` 指向其他容器路径）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/commit/98aff324b7d8500ff75a8ca9ac087ee636be4716","https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/releases/tag/v5.1.6","https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/security/advisories/GHSA-7h3g-4w2f-fj2f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54727.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54727.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/proot-distro/CVE-2026-54727.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_4_CVE-2026-54727.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/67b09f6404b22a39a012a93cc04913fc3a1d2e62/2026/CVE-2026-54727/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0795.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0787","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0787.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54693","title":"ZITADEL ZITADEL 邮箱与电话自验证权限绕过漏洞","description":"ZITADEL 开源身份管理平台存在不正确的授权漏洞（CWE-863），其用户自管理 API 路径（internal/command/user_v2_email.go、user_v2_phone.go 及 user_v2_human.go）在返回邮箱和手机验证码时缺少必要的权限检查。已认证的攻击者可通过调用自管理接口获取验证码，从而声明其并不实际控制的邮箱地址或手机号码的所有权，绕过基于邮箱或手机的安全策略。该漏洞影响 ZITADEL 2.43.0 至 2.71.19、3.0.0 至 3.4.10 及 4.0.0 至 4.15.0 版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。厂商已在 3.4.11 和 4.15.1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54693","GHSA-jq8w-8q2f-ffm9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T17:16:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T20:07:01Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 ZITADEL 至 v4.15.1（4.x 分支）或 v3.4.11（3.x/2.x 分支），这两个版本已修复邮箱/电话自验证权限检查缺陷。如无法立即升级，可通过配置 action (v2) 拦截返回验证码的 API 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/commit/90f310212d3a5075084a603bf61fed549c92956d","https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/commit/a1748b2f0326ddf7be0de44b4f980ae2c07c0151","https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/commit/ed09b3df7f43e870423e4d8f2757e6894481604f","https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/releases/tag/v3.4.11","https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/releases/tag/v4.15.1","https://github.com/zitadel/zitadel/security/advisories/GHSA-jq8w-8q2f-ffm9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54693.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/go/github.com/zitadel/zitadel/CVE-2026-54693.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54693/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54693.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2026/CVE-2026-54693.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0787.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0787.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0786","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0786.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54680","title":"Kube-Logging Logging operator Fluentd 配置注入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Logging operator 在渲染 Fluentd 配置时未对 CRD 中的字符串（如 Flow 资源的 record_transformer.records 值）进行转义处理，导致具有 Flow 资源创建权限的攻击者可通过在记录值中注入换行符和 Fluentd 配置指令，闭合当前配置块并插入包含 @type exec 插件的恶意 <match **> 块，从而在 Fluentd 聚合器容器中执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Logging operator 6.6.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.9，危害等级严重。攻击者仅需在受监控命名空间内具备 Flow 和 Output 资源的创建权限即可触发利用，在 AWS EKS 等云环境中还可进一步通过 IMDS 获取节点元数据，造成横向移动风险。官方已在 6.6.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54680","GHSA-mjqf-28ph-426h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-30T14:16:59Z","remediation":"立即将 Logging operator 升级至 v6.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 Fluentd 配置渲染器未转义 CRD 值的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Fluentd 配置中禁用 @type exec 插件（通过设置环境变量 FLUENTD_DISABLE_EXEC_PLUGIN=true），并严格限制 Flow/Output 资源的创建权限至受信命名空间。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kube-logging/logging-operator/commit/cf437d7f1e056c78740bf5716ac8bdebcf002425","https://github.com/kube-logging/logging-operator/releases/tag/6.6.0","https://github.com/kube-logging/logging-operator/security/advisories/GHSA-mjqf-28ph-426h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54680.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54680.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54680.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/88cbec18e8986267a5177abe3b5d30596aa11172/2026/CVE-2026-54680/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/88cbec18e8986267a5177abe3b5d30596aa11172/2026/CVE-2026-54680/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0786.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0786.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0786.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0785","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0785.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54574","title":"Termux proot-distro 符号链接逃逸任意主机文件写入漏洞","description":"proot-distro 是一款用于管理 proot 容器的 Termux 工具，其安装功能中的 `_extract_plain_tar()` 和 `_apply_layer()` 函数在解压 tar 归档时仅校验了成员文件名中的 `..` 路径穿越，但未对符号链接目标（`member.linkname`）做任何安全检查。攻击者可构造恶意 tar 归档，在解压目录内植入指向宿主机绝对路径的符号链接，随后通过该符号链接将文件写入宿主机文件系统。该漏洞无需容器运行即可触发，仅需用户执行 `proot-distro install` 安装恶意归档即可实现任意文件写入，可被用于覆盖 `~/.bashrc` 等关键文件实现持久化代码执行。影响 proot-distro 5.1.5 之前版本，CVSS 评分 8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54574","GHSA-9xq3-3fqg-4vg7"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T17:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-30T20:07:01Z","remediation":"立即升级 proot-distro 至 5.1.5 或更高版本（`pkg upgrade proot-distro`）。如无法升级，在 `_extract_plain_tar()` 和 `_apply_layer()` 中添加对 `member.linkname` 的校验，拒绝绝对路径符号链接目标或解析后超出 rootfs 目录的符号链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/commit/a96d7a9667f38e45d812614852ee3915d1c0ae45","https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/releases/tag/v5.1.5","https://github.com/termux/proot-distro/security/advisories/GHSA-9xq3-3fqg-4vg7","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54574.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-545xx/CVE-2026-54574.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/proot-distro/CVE-2026-54574.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_3_CVE-2026-54574.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/88cbec18e8986267a5177abe3b5d30596aa11172/2026/CVE-2026-54574/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0785.toml"}]